18	4500	48	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: Create your tasks in an instant"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n                    <p class=\\"tip_title\\"><b>Tip: Create your tasks in an instant</b></p>\\n                    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Use keywords in the title to set task details automatically. For example, type:<br>\\n                    <code>Improve the configuration screen 5h #feature #v20 @<t t-out=\\"ctx.get('digest_tip_recipient_name', 'Name')\\">Name</t> !</code><br>\\n                    and watch the magic happen!</p>\\n                    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/project/static/src/img/create_tasks_in_instant.png\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n                </div>\\n            ", "es_ES": "<div>\\n                    <p class=\\"tip_title\\"><b>Tip: Create your tasks in an instant</b></p>\\n                    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Use keywords in the title to set task details automatically. For example, type:<br>\\n                    <code>Improve the configuration screen 5h #feature #v20 @<t t-out=\\"ctx.get('digest_tip_recipient_name', 'Name')\\">Nombre</t> !</code><br>\\n                    and watch the magic happen!</p>\\n                    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/project/static/src/img/create_tasks_in_instant.png\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n                </div>\\n            "}	2026-10-26 23:49:03.443541	2026-10-26 23:49:03.443541
16	3900	49	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: Project-Specific Fields", "es_ES": "Consejo: campos específicos para sus proyectos"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n                <p class=\\"tip_title\\"><b>Tip: Project-Specific Fields</b></p>\\n                <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Add project-specific property fields to tasks to better customize your project management process.</p>\\n                <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/project/static/src/img/project_fields.png\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n            </div>\\n            "}	2026-10-26 23:49:03.443541	2026-10-26 23:49:03.443541
14	1300	48	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: Create tasks from incoming emails", "es_ES": "Consejo: cree tareas desde sus correos electrónicos"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n                <p class=\\"tip_title\\"><b>Tip: Create tasks from incoming emails</b></p>\\n                <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Emails sent to your project's email address automatically create tasks in it.</p>\\n                <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/project/static/src/img/create_tasks_emails.png\\" width=\\"720\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n            </div>\\n            "}	2026-10-26 23:49:03.443541	2026-10-26 23:49:03.443541
23	500	1	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: Create to-dos from anywhere"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n                <p class=\\"tip_title\\"><b>Tip: Create to-dos from anywhere</b></p>\\n                <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Wherever you are, use the magic keyboard shortcut to set yourself a reminder: 💡<br>\\n                    <ul>\\n                        <li><b>Alt + Shift + T</b> (Windows/Linux)</li>\\n                        <li><b>Ctrl + Shift + T</b> (macOS)</li>\\n                    </ul>\\n                </p>\\n                <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/project_todo/static/src/img/create_to-dos_anywhere.png\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n            </div>\\n            "}	2026-10-26 23:49:18.153705	2026-10-29 01:48:34.143557
24	1000	56	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: Speed up inventory operations with barcodes", "es_ES": "Consejo: acelere las operaciones de inventario con códigos de barras"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Tip: Speed up inventory operations with barcodes</p>\\n    <table class=\\"tip_twocol\\">\\n        <tr>\\n            <td class=\\"tip_twocol_left\\" style=\\"width: 45%;\\">\\n                <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/stock/static/src/img/barcode.gif\\" class=\\"tip_twocol_img\\" width=\\"240\\">\\n            </td>\\n            <td style=\\"width: 55%;\\">\\n                <p class=\\"tip_content\\" style=\\"margin: 0;\\">Enjoy a quick-paced experience with the Odoo barcode app. It is blazing fast and works even without a stable internet connection. It supports all flows: inventory adjustments, batch picking, moving lots or pallets, low inventory checks, etc. Go to the \\"Apps\\" menu to activate the barcode interface.</p>\\n            </td>\\n        </tr>\\n    </table>\\n    <div style=\\"clear: both;\\"></div>\\n</div>\\n            ", "es_ES": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Consejo: acelere las operaciones de inventario con códigos de barras</p>\\n    <table class=\\"tip_twocol\\">\\n        <tr>\\n            <td class=\\"tip_twocol_left\\" style=\\"width: 45%;\\">\\n                <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/stock/static/src/img/barcode.gif\\" class=\\"tip_twocol_img\\" width=\\"240\\">\\n            </td>\\n            <td style=\\"width: 55%;\\">\\n                <p class=\\"tip_content\\" style=\\"margin: 0;\\">Disfrute de una experiencia de ritmo rápido con la aplicación de código de barras Odoo. Es increíblemente rápido y funciona incluso sin una conexión a Internet estable. Admite todos los flujos: ajustes de inventario, preparación de pedidos por lotes, mover lotes o paletas, controles de inventario bajo, etc. Vaya al menú \\"Aplicaciones\\" para activar la interfaz de código de barras.</p>\\n            </td>\\n        </tr>\\n    </table>\\n    <div style=\\"clear: both;\\"></div>\\n</div>\\n            "}	2026-10-26 23:55:10.724392	2026-10-26 23:55:10.724392
25	4000	56	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: Monitor Lot details", "es_ES": "Consejo: supervise los detalles del lote"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Tip: Monitor Lot details</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Store and retrieve information regarding every Lot/Serial Number (condition, product info, ...).</p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/stock/static/src/img/18-stock-property-fields.gif\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n</div>\\n            ", "es_ES": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Consejo: supervise los detalles del lote</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Almacene y consulte la información relacionada con el número de serie o lote (condición, información del producto...)</p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/stock/static/src/img/18-stock-property-fields.gif\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n</div>\\n            "}	2026-10-26 23:55:10.724392	2026-10-26 23:55:10.724392
27	100	75	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: How to keep late receipts under control?", "es_ES": "Consejo: ¿Cómo mantener bajo control los recibos atrasados?"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Tip: How to keep late receipts under control?</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">When creating a purchase order, have a look at the vendor's <i>On Time Delivery</i> rate: the percentage of products shipped on time. If it is too low, activate the <i>automated reminders</i>. A few days before the due shipment, Odoo will send the vendor an email to ask confirmation of shipment dates and keep you informed in case of any delays. To get the vendor's performance statistics, click on the OTD rate.</p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/purchase/static/src/img/milk-OTDPurchase.gif\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n</div>\\n            ", "es_ES": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Consejo: ¿Cómo mantener bajo control los recibos atrasados?</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Al crear un pedido de compra, observe la tasa de <i>entrega a tiempo</i> del proveedor, la cual muestra el porcentaje de productos que este proveedor ha entregado a tiempo. Si es demasiado bajo, active los <i>recordatorios automáticos</i> . Unos días antes del vencimiento del envío, Odoo enviará al proveedor un correo electrónico para solicitar la confirmación de las fechas de envío y mantenerlo informado en caso de retrasos. Para obtener las estadísticas de rendimiento del proveedor, haga clic en la tasa de entrega justo a tiempo.</p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/purchase/static/src/img/milk-OTDPurchase.gif\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n</div>\\n            "}	2026-10-27 00:01:55.233435	2026-10-28 01:48:22.914743
26	600	69	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: Use tablets in the shop to control manufacturing", "es_ES": "Consejo: utilice tabletas electrónicas en el taller para controlar la fabricación"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Tip: Use tablets in the shop to control manufacturing</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">With the Odoo work center control panel, your worker can start work orders in the shop and follow instructions of the worksheet. Quality tests are perfectly integrated into the process. Workers can trigger feedback loops, maintenance alerts, scrap products, etc.</p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/mrp/static/src/img/milk-mrp-tablet.png\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n</div>\\n            ", "es_ES": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Consejo: utilice tabletas electrónicas en el taller para controlar la fabricación</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Con el panel de control del centro de trabajo de Odoo, su trabajador puede iniciar órdenes de trabajo en el taller y seguir instrucciones en las hojas de trabajo. Las pruebas de calidad están perfectamente integradas en el proceso. Los trabajadores pueden activar bucles de comentarios, alertas de mantenimiento, productos desechados, etc.</p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/mrp/static/src/img/milk-mrp-tablet.png\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n</div>\\n            "}	2026-10-26 23:55:22.988604	2026-10-30 01:49:03.045589
28	2000	75	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: Never miss a purchase order", "es_ES": "Consejo: Nunca pierda un pedido de compra"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Tip: Never miss a purchase order</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">When sending a purchase order by email, Odoo asks the vendor to acknowledge the reception of the order. When the vendor acknowledges the order by clicking on a button in the email, the information is added on the purchase order. Use filters to track orders that have not been acknowledged.</p>\\n</div>\\n            ", "es_ES": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Consejo: Nunca pierda un pedido de compra</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Al enviar un pedido de compra por correo electrónico, Odoo le pide al proveedor que reconozca la recepción del mismo. Cuando el proveedor reconoce el pedido haciendo clic en un botón en el correo electrónico, la información se añade en el pedido de compra. Utilice filtros para realizar un seguimiento de los pedidos que no han sido confirmados.</p>\\n</div>\\n            "}	2026-10-27 00:01:55.233435	2026-10-27 00:01:55.233435
\.


