374	\N	\N	2026-10-27 00:01:55.233435	1	https://www.odoo.com/app/manufacturing	{"en_US": "Analytic accounting in Manufacturing"}	mrp_account	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	20.0.1.0	{"en_US": "Accounting - MRP"}	57	{"en_US": "\\nAnalytic Accounting in MRP\\n==========================\\n\\n* Cost structure report\\n\\nAlso, allows to compute the cost of the product based on its BoM, using the costs of its components and work center operations.\\nIt adds a button on the product itself but also an action in the list view of the products.\\nIf the automated inventory valuation is active, the necessary accounting entries will be created.\\n\\n"}	f	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N		WIP report	* INHERIT account.analytic.account.form.mrp (form)\n* INHERIT account.move.inherit.mrp.account (form)\n* INHERIT mrp.production.graph.inherited.mrp.account (graph)\n* INHERIT mrp.production.pivot.inherit.mrp.account (pivot)\n* INHERIT mrp.production.view.inherited (form)\n* INHERIT mrp.workcenter.form.inherit (form)\n* INHERIT mrp_account.bom.form (form)\n* INHERIT mrp_account.mo_overview_components (qweb)\n* INHERIT product.product.view.form.normal.inherit.extended (form)\n* INHERIT product_extended.product.form.view (form)\nPost WIP Accounting Entry (form)\nmrp_account.report_wip (qweb)	\N	official	\N
