50	16	\N	1	1	ir.model.fields form	ir.model.fields	\N	form	base/views/ir_model_views.xml	primary	\N	{"en_US": "<form string=\\"Fields\\" duplicate=\\"false\\">\\n                    <sheet>\\n                        <group>\\n                            <group>\\n                                <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                <field name=\\"field_description\\"/>\\n                                <field name=\\"model_id\\" readonly=\\"state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                            </group>\\n                            <group>\\n                                <field name=\\"ttype\\"/>\\n                                <field name=\\"help\\"/>\\n                            </group>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <notebook>\\n                            <page name=\\"base\\" string=\\"Properties\\">\\n                                <group>\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"required\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"readonly\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"store\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"allowed_index_types\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                                        <!-- necessary for the widget's option -->\\n                                        <field name=\\"index\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" widget=\\"filterable_selection\\" options=\\"{'whitelist_fname': 'allowed_index_types'}\\" readonly=\\"state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"copied\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"state\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"modules\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"translate\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"size\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'reference']\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"relation\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" required=\\"ttype in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"group_expand\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'selection']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'selection']\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"on_delete\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2one'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2one'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"relation_field\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'one2many' or related or compute\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'one2many'\\" required=\\"ttype == 'one2many' and not related and not compute\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"relation_model_field\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2one_reference'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2one_reference'\\" required=\\"ttype == 'many2one_reference'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"relation_table\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"column1\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"column2\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"domain\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"currency_field\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'monetary'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'monetary'\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <group string=\\"HTML/Sanitization Properties\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html'\\">\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_overridable\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_tags\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_attributes\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_style\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_form\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"strip_style\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"strip_classes\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <group invisible=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"selection_ids\\">\\n                                        <list editable=\\"bottom\\">\\n                                            <field name=\\"sequence\\" widget=\\"handle\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"value\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                        </list>\\n                                    </field>\\n                                </group>\\n                            </page>\\n                            <page name=\\"compute\\" string=\\"Compute\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype == 'one2many' and relation_field\\">\\n                                <group>\\n                                    <field name=\\"related\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"depends\\" required=\\"bool(compute) and store\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"compute\\" widget=\\"code\\" options=\\"{'mode': 'python'}\\"/>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <div>\\n                                    <h3>How to define a computed field</h3>\\n                                    <p>Computed fields are defined with the fields\\n                                    <strong>Dependencies</strong> and <strong>Compute</strong>.</p>\\n                                    <p>The field <strong>Dependencies</strong> lists the fields that\\n                                    the current field depends on. It is a comma-separated list of\\n                                    field names, like <code>name, size</code>. You can also refer to\\n                                    fields accessible through other relational fields, for instance\\n                                    <code>partner_id.company_id.name</code>.</p>\\n                                    <p>The field <strong>Compute</strong> is the Python code to\\n                                    compute the value of the field on a set of records. The value of\\n                                    the field must be assigned to each record with a dictionary-like\\n                                    assignment.</p>\\n                                    <pre>\\n    for record in self:\\n        record['size'] = len(record.name)\\n</pre>\\n                                    <p>The only predefined variables are</p>\\n                                    <ul>\\n                                        <li><code>self</code> (the set of records to compute)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>datetime</code> (Python module)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>dateutil</code> (Python module)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>time</code> (Python module)</li>\\n                                    </ul>\\n                                    <p>Other features are accessible through <code>self</code>, like\\n                                    <code>self.env</code>, etc.</p>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </page>\\n                            <page name=\\"groups\\" string=\\"Access Rights\\">\\n                                <field name=\\"groups\\"/>\\n                            </page>\\n                        </notebook>\\n                    </sheet>\\n                </form>", "es_ES": "<form string=\\"Campos\\" duplicate=\\"false\\">\\n                    <sheet>\\n                        <group>\\n                            <group>\\n                                <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                <field name=\\"field_description\\"/>\\n                                <field name=\\"model_id\\" readonly=\\"state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                            </group>\\n                            <group>\\n                                <field name=\\"ttype\\"/>\\n                                <field name=\\"help\\"/>\\n                            </group>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <notebook>\\n                            <page name=\\"base\\" string=\\"Propiedades\\">\\n                                <group>\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"required\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"readonly\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"store\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"allowed_index_types\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                                        <!-- necessary for the widget's option -->\\n                                        <field name=\\"index\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" widget=\\"filterable_selection\\" options=\\"{'whitelist_fname': 'allowed_index_types'}\\" readonly=\\"state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"copied\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"state\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"modules\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"translate\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"size\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'reference']\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"relation\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" required=\\"ttype in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"group_expand\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'selection']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'selection']\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"on_delete\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2one'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2one'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"relation_field\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'one2many' or related or compute\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'one2many'\\" required=\\"ttype == 'one2many' and not related and not compute\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"relation_model_field\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2one_reference'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2one_reference'\\" required=\\"ttype == 'many2one_reference'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"relation_table\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"column1\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"column2\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"domain\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"currency_field\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'monetary'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'monetary'\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <group string=\\"HTML/Propiedades de depuración\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html'\\">\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_overridable\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_tags\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_attributes\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_style\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_form\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"strip_style\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"strip_classes\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <group invisible=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"selection_ids\\">\\n                                        <list editable=\\"bottom\\">\\n                                            <field name=\\"sequence\\" widget=\\"handle\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"value\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                        </list>\\n                                    </field>\\n                                </group>\\n                            </page>\\n                            <page name=\\"compute\\" string=\\"Calcular\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype == 'one2many' and relation_field\\">\\n                                <group>\\n                                    <field name=\\"related\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"depends\\" required=\\"bool(compute) and store\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"compute\\" widget=\\"code\\" options=\\"{'mode': 'python'}\\"/>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <div>\\n                                    <h3>Cómo definir un campo calculado</h3>\\n                                    <p>Los campos calculados son definidos con los campos <strong>Dependencias</strong> y <strong>Calcular</strong>.</p>\\n                                    <p>El campo <strong>Dependencias</strong> enlista los campos de los que\\n                                                depende el campo actual. Es una lista de nombres de campos\\n                                                separados por compas, como <code>nombre, tamaño</code>. También se puede referir a \\n                                                campos accesibles a través de otros campos relacionales, por ejemplo\\n                                                <code>partner_id.company_id.name</code>.</p>\\n                                    <p>El campo <strong>Calcular</strong> es el código Python\\n                                       para calcular el valor del campo en un conjunto de registros. El valor del\\n                                       campo debe asignarse a cada registro con una asignación\\n                                        como de diccionario.</p>\\n                                    <pre>\\n    para registrar en self:\\n        record['size'] = len(record.name)\\n</pre>\\n                                    <p>Las únicas variables predefinidas</p>\\n                                    <ul>\\n                                        <li><code>self</code> (el conjunto de registros para calcular)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>datetime</code> (Módulo Python)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>dateutil</code> (Módulo Python)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>time</code> (Módulo Python)</li>\\n                                    </ul>\\n                                    <p>Se puede acceder a otras funciones a través de <code>self</code>, como\\n<code>self.env</code>, etc.</p>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </page>\\n                            <page name=\\"groups\\" string=\\"Permisos de acceso\\">\\n                                <field name=\\"groups\\"/>\\n                            </page>\\n                        </notebook>\\n                    </sheet>\\n                </form>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<form string="Fields" duplicate="false">\n                    <sheet>\n                        <group