ul>\n                                <li>CSV format: you may edit it directly with your favorite spreadsheet software,\n                                    the rightmost column (value) contains the translations</li>\n                                <li>PO(T) format: you should edit it with a PO editor such as\n                                    <a href="http://www.poedit.net/" target="_blank">POEdit</a>, or your preferred text editor</li>\n                                <li>TGZ format: bundles multiple PO(T) files as a single archive</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </p>\n                            <p>For more details about translating Odoo in your language, please refer to the\n                                <a href="https://github.com/odoo/odoo/wiki/Translations" target="_blank">documentation</a>.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <footer invisible="state != 'choose'">\n                        <button name="act_getfile" data-hotkey="q" string="Export" type="object" class="btn-primary"/>\n                        <button special="cancel" data-hotkey="x" type="object" class="btn-secondary"/>\n                    </footer>\n                    <footer invisible="state != 'get'">\n                        <button special="cancel" data-hotkey="x" string="Close" type="object" class="btn-primary"/>\n                    </footer>\n                </form>\n            	\N	f	t	2026-10-26 23:38:33.217677	2026-10-26 23:38:33.217677	\N
108	16	\N	1	1	base.partner.merge.automatic.wizard.form	base.partner.merge.automatic.wizard	\N	form	base/wizard/base_partner_merge_views.xml	primary	\N	{"en_US": "<form string=\\"Automatic Merge Wizard\\" class=\\"o_partner_merge_wizard\\">\\n                    <sheet>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state != 'finished'\\">\\n                            <h2 colspan=\\"2\\">There are no more contacts to merge for this request</h2>\\n                            <button name=\\"46\\" string=\\"Deduplicate the other Contacts\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" type=\\"action\\" colspan=\\"2\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <p class=\\"opacity-50\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\">\\n                            Select the list of fields used to search for\\n                            duplicated records. If you select several fields,\\n                            Odoo will propose you to merge only those having\\n                            all these fields in common. (not one of the fields).\\n                        </p>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state not in ('selection', 'finished') or number_group == 0\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"number_group\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <group string=\\"Search duplicates based on duplicated data in\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_email\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_name\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_is_company\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_vat\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_parent_id\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <group string=\\"Exclude contacts having\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"exclude_contact\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"exclude_journal_item\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <separator string=\\"Options\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\"/>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state not in ('option', 'finished')\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"maximum_group\\" readonly=\\"state == 'finished'\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <separator string=\\"Merge the following contacts\\" invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\"/>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\" col=\\"1\\">\\n                            <p class=\\"opacity-50\\">\\n                                Selected contacts will be merged together.\\n                                All documents linked to one of these contacts\\n                                will be redirected to the destination contact.\\n                                You can remove contacts from this list to avoid merging them.\\n                            </p>\\n                            <group col=\\"2\\">\\n                                <field name=\\"dst_partner_id\\" domain=\\"[('id', 'in', partner_ids or False)]\\" required=\\"state == 'selection'\\" context=\\"{'partner_show_db_id': True}\\"/>\\n                            </group>\\n                            <field name=\\"partner_ids\\" nolabel=\\"1\\">\\n                                <list string=\\"Partners\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"id\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"display_name\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"email\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"vat\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"country_id\\"/>\\n                                </list>\\n                            </field>\\n                        </group>\\n                    </sheet>\\n                    <footer>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_merge\\" string=\\"Merge Contacts\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" type=\\"object\\" data-hotkey=\\"q\\" invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_skip\\" string=\\"Skip these contacts\\" type=\\"object\\" invisible=\\"state != 'selection'\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_start_manual_process\\" string=\\"Merge with Manual Check\\" data-hotkey=\\"w\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_start_automatic_process\\" string=\\"Merge Automatically\\" data-hotkey=\\"l\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" confirm=\\"Are you sure to execute the automatic merge of your contacts?\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_update_all_process\\" string=\\"Merge Automatically all process\\" type=\\"object\\" data-hotkey=\\"y\\" confirm=\\"Are you sure to execute the list of automatic merges of your contacts?\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\"/>\\n                        <button special=\\"cancel\\" data-hotkey=\\"x\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn btn-secondary oe_inline\\" invisible=\\"state == 'finished'\\"/>\\n                        <button special=\\"cancel\\" data-hotkey=\\"x\\" string=\\"Close\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn btn-secondary oe_inline\\" invisible=\\"state != 'finished'\\"/>\\n                    </footer>\\n                </form>", "es_ES": "<form string=\\"Asistente de fusión automática\\" class=\\"o_partner_merge_wizard\\">\\n                    <sheet>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state != 'finished'\\">\\n                            <h2 colspan=\\"2\\">No hay más contactos para combinar para esta solicitud</h2>\\n                            <button name=\\"46\\" string=\\"Deduplicar los otros contactos\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" type=\\"action\\" colspan=\\"2\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <p class=\\"opacity-50\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\">\\n                            Seleccione la lista de campos usada para buscar\\n                            registros duplicados. Si selecciona varios campos,\\n                            Odoo le propondrá fusionar solo aquellos\\n                            que tengan todos esos campos en común (no uno de los campos).\\n                        </p>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state not in ('selection', 'finished') or number_group == 0\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"number_group\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <group string=\\"Buscar duplicados basados en datos duplicados en\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_email\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_name\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_is_company\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_vat\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"group_by_parent_id\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <group string=\\"Excluir los contactos que tienen\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"exclude_contact\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"exclude_journal_item\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <separator string=\\"Opciones\\" invisible=\\"state not in ('option',)\\"/>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state not in ('option', 'finished')\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"maximum_group\\" readonly=\\"state == 'finished'\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <separator string=\\"Fusionar los siguientes contactos\\" invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\"/>\\n                        <group invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\" col=\\"1\\">\\n                            <p class=\\"opacity-50\\">\\n                                Los contactos seleccionados serán fusionados.\\nTodos los documentos enlazados en uno de estos contactos serán redireccionados al contacto de destino. \\nPuede eliminar los contactos de esta lista para evitar fusionarlos.\\n                            </p>\\n                            <group col=\\"2\\">\\n                                <field name=\\"dst_partner_id\\" domain=\\"[('id', 'in', partner_ids or False)]\\" required=\\"state == 'selection'\\" context=\\"{'partner_show_db_id': True}\\"/>\\n                            </group>\\n                            <field name=\\"partner_ids\\" nolabel=\\"1\\">\\n                                <list string=\\"Contactos\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"id\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"display_name\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"email\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"vat\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"country_id\\"/>\\n                                </list>\\n                            </field>\\n                        </group>\\n                    </sheet>\\n                    <footer>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_merge\\" string=\\"Fusionar contactos\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" type=\\"object\\" data-hotkey=\\"q\\" invisible=\\"state in ('option', 'finished')\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_skip\\" string=\\"Saltar estos contactos\\" type=\\"object\\" invisible=\\"state != 'selection'\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_start_manual_process\\" string=\\"Fusionar con verificación manual\\" data-hotkey=\\"w\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_start_automatic_process\\" string=\\"Fusionar automáticamente\\" data-hotkey=\\"l\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"oe_highlight\\" confirm=\\"¿Está seguro que desea ejecutar la fusión automática de sus contactos?\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\"/>\\n                        <button name=\\"action_update_all_process\\" string=\\"Fusionar automáticamente todos los procesos\\" type=\\"object\\" data-hotkey=\\"y\\" confirm=\\"¿Está seguro que desea ejecutar la lista de fusiones automáticas de sus contactos?\\" invisible=\\"state != 'option'\\"/>\\n                        <button special=\\"cancel\\" data-hotkey=\\"x\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn btn-secondary oe_inline\\" invisible=\\"state == 'finished'\\"/>\\n                        <button special=\\"cancel\\" data-hotkey=\\"x\\" string=\\"Cerrar\\" type=\\"object\\" class=\\"btn btn-secondary oe_inline\\" invisible=\\"state != 'finished'\\"/>\\n                    </footer>\\n                </form>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<form string="Automatic Merge Wizard" class="o_partner_merge_wizard">\n                    <sheet>\n                        <group invisible="state != 'finished'">\n                            <h2 colspan="2">There are no more contacts to merge for this request</h2>\n                            <button name="46" string="Deduplicate the other Contacts" class="oe_highlight" type="action" colspan="2"/>\n                        </group>\n                        <p class="opacity-50" invisible="state != 'option'">\n                            Select the list of fields used to search for\n                            duplicated records. If you select several fields,\n                            Odoo will propose you to merge only those having\n                            all these fields in common. (not one of the fields).\n                        </p>\n                        <group invisible="state not in ('selection', 'finished') or number_group == 0">\n                            <field name="number_group"/>\n                        </group>\n                        <group string="Search duplicat